#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "A URL field on each document leading back to the application here, created in Paperless if missing. Leave blank for none."
msgstr "Un camp URL a cada document que porta de tornada a la candidatura d'aquí; si no existeix, es crea al Paperless. Deixeu-lo en blanc per no fer-ne servir cap."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "API token"
msgstr "Testimoni d'API"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Custom field for the application's link"
msgstr "Camp personalitzat per a l'enllaç de la candidatura"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "From your Paperless profile. Stored encrypted; never shown again."
msgstr "Del vostre perfil del Paperless. Es desa xifrat; no es torna a mostrar mai."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Give the whole address, beginning with https://."
msgstr "Indiqueu l'adreça completa, començant per https://."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Paperless address"
msgstr "Adreça del Paperless"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Paperless answered with more than this plugin reads, or too slowly."
msgstr "El Paperless ha respost amb més dades de les que llegeix aquest connector, o massa lentament."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Paperless consumed the document but gave no id."
msgstr "El Paperless ha processat el document, però no n'ha retornat cap identificador."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, python-format
msgid "Paperless could not consume the document: %(reason)s"
msgstr "El Paperless no ha pogut processar el document: %(reason)s"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Paperless is still consuming the document; it will be checked again."
msgstr "El Paperless encara està processant el document; es tornarà a comprovar."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, python-format
msgid "Paperless no longer accepts the API token (%(reason)s). Enter a current one, then switch the connection on again."
msgstr "El Paperless ja no accepta el testimoni d'API (%(reason)s). Introduïu-ne un de vigent i torneu a activar la connexió."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Paperless-ngx"
msgstr "Paperless-ngx"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Put on every document that came from Postulo. Leave blank for none."
msgstr "S'afegeix a cada document que prové de Postulo. Deixeu-lo en blanc per no afegir-ne cap."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
#, python-format
msgid "Reachable. The archive holds %(count)d document."
msgid_plural "Reachable. The archive holds %(count)d documents."
msgstr[0] "Accessible. L'arxiu conté %(count)d document."
msgstr[1] "Accessible. L'arxiu conté %(count)d documents."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Tag"
msgstr "Etiqueta"

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "This would send your API token unencrypted to a server on the internet, where anything along the way can read it. Use https://."
msgstr "Això enviaria el vostre testimoni d'API sense xifrar a un servidor d'Internet, on qualsevol intermediari el podria llegir. Utilitzeu https://."

#: src/postulo_paperless/store.py
msgid "Where you open Paperless, e.g. https://paperless.example.org."
msgstr "On obriu el Paperless, p. ex. https://paperless.example.org."
